fact that it used to be  a bit campier than it got later on and  the fact that he had a lot of politics  very baked in to a lot of the stuff that  he wrote and that his work since doctor  who has only gotten more outright  political i will not be shocked  to see um  certain folks within  fan circles turn on davies when they  either  realize properly for the first time or  remember  just how political this guy is  and can be and has been  and should be  he's good at it  because gymnal wasn't great  on that stuff so again davey's back  because it's him and  again not because i think he's the  greatest thing ever there were issues  with his era i would be happy to go over  them if you want me to but i'm trying to  be as positive as i can right now even  with my concerns but he's back and i am  kind of excited because of who he's  become as an artist as opposed to  thinking oh he will bring back what it  was before i don't think he will or at  least i hope he won't because i want him  to do something new because that's what  i always want doctor who to do in some  way  is to move forward and do something new  i really  really  don't  want to see  people start speculating or saying that  they should bring back an older actor to  play the doctor again  and yes i know dave the doctor kind of  very strongly hinted that that was a  possibility that he could take on a face  that he had before i i don't care this  is not about the continuity or whether  or not it fits it's about that  stagnation that i talked about before  and about that that wouldn't even be  looking backward that'd be staring up  its own butthole if the show did that  so  i swear i just just i just saw glimpses  of headlines of of speculation of either  tenant or smith coming back no  no  i want to see what davies will do  but the reason is is because i trust him  to do something new  don't turn this into  let's  make it what it used to be  those are my thoughts  on russell t davies coming back to show  run doctor who  what are your thoughts  whatever they are drop something down in  the comments let's talk about it be  polite  to me  to davies and to jib no i'm really sick  of having to scrub comments that are  absolute vitriol about a guy that the  video i'm making isn't even about  really sick of it  you can tell that that's kind of become  a button for me  but as long as you don't do that  i'd love to hear your thoughts on this i  have a patreon and that is how i pay my  bills keep this whole operation up and  running and was able to afford that new  computer i've spent the last couple days  trying to get fully set up and  everything  uh the way i want it  but any amount you're able to assist is  greatly appreciated if you can't or  don't want to use that there's youtube  memberships if you don't want to do that  like share subscribe it'll help me out  you know what hit the bell i never tell  people to do that go ahead hit the bell  but don't worry about that either  because at the end of the day  you are the council i'm only running the  meetings and until next time this  council  is adjourned  [Music]  this video wouldn't have been possible  without the support of my patrons and i  want to give special thanks to jared  boyce  mj the doctor tracy scrabbit vincent  paul bartolucci hayley schwartz  edelman  robin moore ross schultz and shayla  gordon  thanks  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  oh  um  [Music]
 

